        "content": "<p>In the following example, one has to explicitly destruct a (recursive) structure by matching to have termination be derived automatically:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\">-- Returns the cost of a term with the head `String` and child costs `List Nat`.</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CostFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">children</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- failed to show termination</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cost</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">costFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CostFn</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">costFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">children</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">cost</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">costFn</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- succeeds</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cost'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">costFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CostFn</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">children</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">costFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">children</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">cost'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">costFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Is this an expected limitation? (cc <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"470149\">@Joachim Breitner</span>)</p>",
        "id": 607344198,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcus Rossel",
        "timestamp": 1782816661
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yes, it is a known issue. At some point in the future (unclear when yet) the automated termination tactic should be based on grind and that should be able to handle that better</p>",
        "id": 607347987,
        "sender_full_name": "Joachim Breitner",
        "timestamp": 1782817956
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Essentially, right now there is nothing connecting the size of a projection to the size of the whole thing</p>",
